WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.800
A list holds many values, in order, under one name.

2
00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:10.129
Each item has a place, counted from zero. Yes is at zero, Maybe at two.

3
00:00:12.983 --> 00:00:17.258
get value at one takes out the item at place one. That is No.

4
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:22.887
Three items use places zero, one and two. There is no place three.
